# Honored Dreyleader ({2}{G}, 1/1 Squirrel Warrior, trample): "When this creature enters, put a +1/+1 counter on it for each other Squirrel
# and/or Food you control. Whenever another Squirrel or Food you control enters, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature." Turn 1: Bot1
# has a Heaped Harvest (a Food) and a Memnite (an artifact creature, neither a Squirrel nor a Food), so the first Dreyleader enters
# with one counter (a 2/2): the Memnite and the Dreyleader itself do not count. Turn 3: a second Dreyleader counts the first (a Squirrel)
# and the Harvest (a Food), two counters (a 3/3), and entering it is a Squirrel entering for the first, which grows to a 3/3 as well.

